  "description": "DOJGUI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H122 O8 Sm5,3(C6 H14). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm5 (Sm) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.770-3.842 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.88-109.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Sm{Sm2(Cp*)3(phenCat)2}2] (C116H122O8Sm5); crystallized as 9·3C6H14.",
